  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"8 x plus y equals 5\"><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 9 x plus 1\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?&nbsp;</p>",
